WEBVTT

00:28.881 --> 00:32.543
The wind has drove beyond the tree

00:35.829 --> 00:39.691
A sudden calm upon the seas

00:42.692 --> 00:46.414
We watched the lightning strike the ground

00:49.535 --> 00:53.637
But now there is no other sound

00:56.598 --> 01:00.440
The broken glass is swept away

01:03.473 --> 01:11.942
To leave us in the light of day And we are walking

01:12.162 --> 01:14.805
in the silent storm

01:18.148 --> 01:22.432
Waiting for the weather to keep us warm

01:25.003 --> 01:31.287
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind A

01:31.367 --> 01:36.209
quiet place for us to finally find

01:38.911 --> 01:41.032
In the silence

01:56.643 --> 02:00.585
You fold the papers, close the door

02:03.786 --> 02:07.927
We don't need answers anymore

02:10.869 --> 02:14.670
The orchestra has gone to sleep

02:17.871 --> 02:21.653
And gave us promises to keep

02:25.067 --> 02:29.069
We crossed the ocean in the dark

02:32.151 --> 02:40.877
To rescue one remaining spy And we are walking in

02:40.897 --> 02:43.278
the silent storm

02:46.660 --> 02:51.323
Waiting for the weather to keep us warm

02:53.546 --> 02:59.810
The empty space is just a shape we leave behind A

02:59.910 --> 03:05.494
quiet place for us to finally find

03:07.575 --> 03:11.518
In the silent storm

03:25.450 --> 03:33.987
The true light bleeps. It always bleeps. We wake

03:34.127 --> 03:35.309
up from the shattered dreams.

03:49.736 --> 03:52.099
Now, now.

04:38.678 --> 04:40.779
The silent storm

